 <p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-justify:
inter-ideograph;text-indent:-.5in;line-height:12.2pt"><i><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;letter-spacing:-.15pt">Children Act 1989</span></i><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;
letter-spacing:-.15pt"> (U.K.), 1989, c. 41, ss. 3(1), 8(1), 13(1)(b), (3).</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;
line-height:12.2pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;
letter-spacing:-.15pt">&nbsp;</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-justify:
inter-ideograph;text-indent:-.5in;line-height:12.2pt"><i><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;letter-spacing:-.15pt">Children's Act</span></i><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;
letter-spacing:-.15pt">, R.S.Y. 1986, c. 22, s. 31(2), (5), (6).</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;
line-height:12.2pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;
letter-spacing:-.15pt">&nbsp;</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-justify:
inter-ideograph;text-indent:-.5in;line-height:12.2pt"><i><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;letter-spacing:-.15pt">Children's Law Act</span></i><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;
letter-spacing:-.15pt">, R.S.N. 1990, c. C‑13, s. 26(2), (6).</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;
line-height:12.2pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;
letter-spacing:-.15pt">&nbsp;</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-justify:
