 <p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-justify:
inter-ideograph;text-indent:-.5in;line-height:12.2pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;letter-spacing:-.15pt">Sivin, Edward.&nbsp; "Residence Restrictions on Custodial Parents:&nbsp; Implications for the Right to Travel" (1980‑81), 12 <i>Rutgers L.J.</i> 341.</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;
line-height:12.2pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;
letter-spacing:-.15pt">&nbsp;</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-justify:
inter-ideograph;text-indent:-.5in;line-height:12.2pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;letter-spacing:-.15pt">Wallerstein, Judith&nbsp;S.&nbsp; "Children of Divorce:&nbsp; Report of a Ten‑Year Follow‑Up of Early Latency‑Age Children" (1987), 57 <i>Am. J. Orthopsychiatry</i> 199.</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;
line-height:12.2pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;
letter-spacing:-.15pt">&nbsp;</span></p>
